@startuml error_handling_sequence_detailed

actor "用户" as User
participant "RequestFragment\n(前端)" as FE
participant "PolarifyKycSdk" as SDK
participant "后台(Controller)" as BFF
participant "RestTemplate" as RT
participant "RestClientErrorHandler" as EH
participant "后端服务(BA/ABA)" as BE

User -> FE : 点击申し込みボタン
activate FE
FE -> FE : progressBar 显示(VISIBLE)
FE -> SDK : ①getFaceVerification(matchingParameters)
activate SDK

SDK -> BFF : ②发起请求
BFF -> RT : 调用后端接口
RT -> BE : ③转发HTTP请求
BE --> RT : 返回错误(4xx/5xx)
RT -> EH : ④hasError()=true\n触发handleError()

note over EH
  解析Body,判断BA/ABA
  组装errorCode/errorMsg
end note

EH --> BFF : ⑤抛出对应异常\n(如BadRequestException)
BFF --> SDK : ⑥返回错误response

alt 成功 onSuccess(results)
    SDK --> FE : callback onSuccess(VerificationResults)
    FE -> FE : requestButton.unlock()\nprogressBar 隐藏(INVISIBLE)
    FE -> FE : Handler延迟1秒
    FE -> FE : ⑦showSuccessDialog(results)
    FE -> User : 展示成功 AlertDialog
    User -> FE : 点击"OK"
    FE -> SDK : deleteFace()\ndeleteMatchingData(parameters)
    SDK --> FE : callback onSuccess/onError
    FE -> FE : replaceFragment()
    FE -> FE : 替换为 RequestResultFragment
else 失败 onError(errorResult)
    SDK --> FE : callback onError(ErrorResult)\n(含解析后的errorCode/errorMsg)
    FE -> FE : requestButton.unlock()\nprogressBar 隐藏(INVISIBLE)
    FE -> FE : Handler延迟1秒
    FE -> FE : ⑧showErrorDialog(errorResult)
    FE -> User : 展示错误 AlertDialog
    User -> FE : 点击"OK"
    FE -> FE : dialog.dismiss()
end
deactivate SDK
deactivate FE

@enduml
